model lo
  tally 2
  on 2026-02-15
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-03-31
  note "T, M3 C5, gate 8's walk/reads.rs less_own_obs (E §4.2 step 3, L §5.19): a decision an observation fulfils two days early, computed less that observation at both of its leg's places: the place it runs from (konto, added back) and the place it runs to (jar, taken back); a twin reads only the place no leg of it touches"

source fixture "T's fixture (invented values)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

index month = month 2026-01..2026-03

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place jar: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place other: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

input bank: observed

input dec_dom: int

input keep: money PLN

input step: money PLN

move sweep[m in month]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dec_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  reads konto, jar
  leg cash from konto to jar amount bal(konto) - bal(jar) - keep

move twin[m in month]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dec_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  reads other
  leg cash from world to other amount bal(other) + step

version facts
  cite fixture
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  dec_dom = 20 "the decisions' day of the month"
  keep = 2 000.00 PLN "what konto keeps above the jar"
  step = 1.00 PLN "a small step"

version openings
  cite fixture
  governs always
  known 2025-12-31
  opening[konto] = 3 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[jar] = 200.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[other] = 10.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start

version bank_jan
  cite fixture
  governs 2026-01
  known 2026-02-02
  covers konto
  bank[b20260118] = (on: 2026-01-18, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to jar amount 700.00 PLN, fulfils: sweep[2026-01]) "the sweep, two days early"

ask q_sweep: explain sweep[2026-01]

ask q_twin: explain twin[2026-01]

ask q_bal: bal(konto, d), bal(jar, d), bal(other, d) for d in [2026-01-19, 2026-01-20, 2026-01-31] law cut
